  "releaseNotes": "0.6.5: Apple Portrait effect. HeifAppleDepthInfo reads the depth item's Apple XMP (disparity range, simulated aperture, raw calibration); HeifDepthImage.AppleDepth and ToImage; Apple matte types and FindAuxiliaryImage/FindDepthImage; HeifDocument.RenderPortrait and HeifPortrait.Render approximate the depth-of-field blur Photos applies at display time (aperture, focus point, matte-protected subject; not identical to Photos). Image decoding unchanged. Requires PictureSharp 0.7.6. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Heif/blob/v0.6.5/docs/releases/release-0.6.5.md",
